  "body": "Elevated amongst the canopy, this serene residence offers a quiet escape from the bustle. Featuring a single-level layout designed for easy living, the home boasts three bedrooms, a well-appointed kitchen and a sun-soaked lounge that flows out to private decking and gardens. There is a double garage for secure parking at street level, with stairs leading up to the property. The journey up the stairs is worth it—once you reach the top, the privacy and peace will surprise you.\r\nWhether you're looking for a 'forever' home to modernise or a solid investment, this property offers the perfect foundation. Enjoy the coastal lifestyle with Waiake Beach nearby and the convenience of local shopping hubs just minutes away.\r\n\r\nGrab this rare opportunity to get a foothold in a premium suburb zoned for top-tier schools like Long Bay College. Your home ownership journey starts here!",
